cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SFCX, please cite it as below."
title: "SFCX — structure–function coupling explorer"
authors:
  - name: "SFCX contributors"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fxywj/sfcx_toolbox"
abstract: >-
  A toolbox that treats structure–function coupling readouts as an explicit
  four-layer coordinate system (definition × pipeline × estimator × scale).
  27 coupling definitions, per-subject coupling values, dispersion axes,
  spatial null models and a cross-runtime (Python/MATLAB) numerical parity
  test suite, with a no-install web interface.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - connectome
  - structure-function coupling
  - neuroimaging
  - reproducibility
